  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The proposed alteration to the roof profile, in terms of its excessive size, positioning and design is an&amp;nbsp;unacceptable addition that would not appear subservient to the host building,&amp;nbsp;resulting in a form of development that would respond negatively to the existing property and its surrounding,&amp;nbsp;to the visual detriment of the existing roofscape character and setting on the relevant street scene. The development would be&amp;nbsp;contrary to Policy CS15 of the&amp;nbsp; Waltham Forest Local Plan Core Strategy (2012), and Policies DM4 and DM29 of the&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Waltham Forest Local Plan Development Management Policies (2013), Policy 56 of Waltham Forests Emerging Local Plan (2021)&amp;nbsp;and Waltham Forest Supplementary Planning Document &quot;Residential Extensions and Alterations&quot; (2010).&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
